# No Unsolicited Copy

Do not add taglines, helper hints, subtitle blurbs, or decorative microcopy to this site unless Vanessa explicitly asked for that text.

- Structural labels (button text, form placeholders, error messages) are fine — they're functional.
- Editorial flourishes ("ideas pitched to the ops team — pin yours to the board") are not. If a section feels like it needs explanation, raise it; don't write it.
- When in doubt, ship the design without the words.
